  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-indigo pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Metamorphic Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Conduits.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190112220909\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Conduits\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Conduits.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190112220909\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Conduits.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190112220909 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2f/Conduits.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20190112220909 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Conduits\" width=\"270\" height=\"329\" data-image-key=\"Conduits.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Conduits.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Through manipulation at the macro-quantum level, Conduits (Infamous: Second Son) can convert their own mass into an element they can use for a variety of applications.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use elements from one's being to manipulate subjects.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>use elements from one's being to manipulate subjects</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Shiftmorphing\" title=\"Shiftmorphing\">Shiftmorphing</a>&#160;and <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Conversion\" title=\"Life-Force Conversion\">Life-Force Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Basic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Basic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Advanced\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Advanced</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Master\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Master</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetamorphic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can manipulate elements of their being and remotely command them by channeling mental, spiritual and/or physical energy through their form, similarly to <a href=\"/wiki/Anatomical_Liberation\" title=\"Anatomical Liberation\">Anatomical Liberation</a>.\n</p><p>These elements can be converted into various forms that can interact with selected subjects, including matter, energy, beings, environments, concepts, etc, allowing the user to manipulate or  assimilate them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetamorphic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Basic\">Basic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetamorphic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Infection\" title=\"Assimilative Infection\">Assimilative Infection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Bio-Absorbing Replication\">Bio-Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Tunneling\" title=\"Quantum Tunneling\">Quantum Tunneling</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Construct_Creation\" title=\"Construct Creation\">Construct Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Disaster_Manipulation\" title=\"Disaster Manipulation\">Disaster Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Psionics\" title=\"Elemental Psionics\">Elemental Psionics</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Transmutation\" title=\"Elemental Transmutation\">Elemental Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Generation\" title=\"Elemental Generation\">Elemental Generation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inorganic_Manipulation\" title=\"Inorganic Manipulation\">Inorganic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Manipulation\" title=\"Organic Manipulation\">Organic Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Morphamerge\" title=\"Morphamerge\">Morphamerge</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Infusion\" title=\"Adaptation Infusion\">Adaptation Infusion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Inducement\" title=\"Adaptation Inducement\">Adaptation Inducement</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Amalgamorphing\" title=\"Amalgamorphing\">Amalgamorphing</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Weaponry_Manipulation\" title=\"Natural Weaponry Manipulation\">Natural Weaponry Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Idiosyncratic_Manipulation\" title=\"Idiosyncratic Manipulation\">Idiosyncratic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm_Dwelling_Creation\" title=\"Phantasm Dwelling Creation\">Phantasm Dwelling Creation</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced\">Advanced</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMetamorphic_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Arts\" title=\"Adaptive Arts\">Adaptive Arts</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Appearance\" title=\"Adaptive Appearance\">Adaptive Appearance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Essence_Manipulation\" title=\"Biological Essence Manipulation\">Biological Essence Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Engineering_Manipulation\" title=\"Engineering Manipulation\">Engineering Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Flux_Manipulation\" title=\"Flux Manipulation\">Flux Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Livin